  "summary": "Cell C6 loads 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 plus 2010-06-01..08-31 for the region, and C7 trims the data to 56.64-57.82N, 20.24-21.42E. C7 then builds per-day-of-year hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day pools, smooths them with a wrapped 31-day mean, and compares them against the target SST for sea cells. Only the smoothed threshold for target days of year 153-244 is used, so it draws on unsmoothed days 138-259, whose pools span May 12-Sep 20 of each baseline year; the climatology is computed but never used."
